			<div class="content" id="post-content-1517079">
									

<p>Most are, but not all of them. This thing will accept anything considered worthless- this includes a book you got but never wanted, an old newspaper, or a family album from a family which might not exist anymore, in one way or another. People throw away stuff which might not be objectively worthless, but it is to them. The reason non of the Foundation's items pass through is that they are interested in them passing, and by doing so giving them worth.</p>

